WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:12.669
When the grown-ups came back, the twins told them everything.

2
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.250
"It was really bright,"

3
00:00:15.251 --> 00:00:20.314
said Jordan, covering his eyes with his little hands.

4
00:00:20.315 --> 00:00:23.753
Vinnie and Mandy held their breath.

5
00:00:23.754 --> 00:00:27.267
Then Dad smiled at the twins.

6
00:00:27.268 --> 00:00:31.072
"What an imagination!" he laughed.

7
00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:34.554
Jordan looked at Vinnie and Mandy.

8
00:00:34.555 --> 00:00:38.948
"Tell them about your book!" he cried.

9
00:00:38.949 --> 00:00:43.752
"Come on, kids," interrupted Aunt Leah.

10
00:00:43.753 --> 00:00:45.747
"It's nap time."

11
00:00:45.748 --> 00:00:48.467
She led them upstairs.

12
00:00:48.468 --> 00:00:53.276
"What about a game of catch?" asked Uncle Wilson.

13
00:00:53.277 --> 00:00:58.384
"Okay! Let me get my mitt," answered Vinnie.

14
00:00:58.385 --> 00:01:01.675
Mandy followed her brother.

15
00:01:01.676 --> 00:01:06.473
"Whew! That was close!" she said.

16
00:01:06.474 --> 00:01:08.965
"We have to be more careful,"

17
00:01:08.966 --> 00:01:12.900
agreed Vinnie, looking for his baseball mitt.

18
00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:15.090
"Do you want to play?"

19
00:01:15.091 --> 00:01:20.075
"No, I'm going to read," said Mandy.

20
00:01:20.076 --> 00:01:23.471
Vinnie stared at his sister.

21
00:01:23.472 --> 00:01:30.086
"Are you planning to go on a photo trip without me?" he said suspiciously.

22
00:01:30.087 --> 00:01:36.163
"You tried to go without me—three times!" she yelled back.

23
00:01:36.164 --> 00:01:40.875
"Only twice!" Vinnie shouted at her.

24
00:01:40.876 --> 00:01:44.513
Mandy ran up to the attic.

25
00:01:44.514 --> 00:01:49.072
"No!" yelled Vinnie as he ran after her.

26
00:01:49.073 --> 00:01:54.351
When Vinnie got to the attic he saw Mandy with the photo album.

27
00:01:54.352 --> 00:01:57.007
Vinnie grabbed it.

28
00:01:57.008 --> 00:02:02.205
"Let go!" cried Mandy, still holding on.

29
00:02:02.206 --> 00:02:05.955
The children pulled the album back and forth.

30
00:02:05.956 --> 00:02:08.342
Then Vinnie let go.

31
00:02:08.343 --> 00:02:12.546
Mandy fell to the floor and dropped the album.

32
00:02:12.547 --> 00:02:16.143
It lay open to another page.

33
00:02:16.144 --> 00:02:21.676
"Hey, this photo is different," said Mandy.

34
00:02:21.677 --> 00:02:24.361
She picked up the photo.

35
00:02:24.362 --> 00:02:27.693
The picture showed a sandy wilderness.

36
00:02:27.694 --> 00:02:30.829
The sun looked very hot.

37
00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.985
The old man was in front of a cave.

38
00:02:33.986 --> 00:02:38.636
Just inside the cave was a glowing object.

39
00:02:38.637 --> 00:02:43.829
"I wonder what's inside the cave?" Vinnie asked.

40
00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.626
The photo glowed brighter.

41
00:02:46.627 --> 00:02:51.865
"Looks like we're going to find out," said Mandy.

42
00:02:51.866 --> 00:02:58.911
The children fell down the dark tunnel and landed on warm sand.

43
00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:02.200
They could feel the heat right away.

44
00:03:02.201 --> 00:03:08.083
"Oh, the sun is really hot," said Vinnie.

45
00:03:08.084 --> 00:03:11.702
He slowly opened his eyes.

46
00:03:11.703 --> 00:03:14.622
"We're in a sort of desert,"

47
00:03:14.623 --> 00:03:19.462
she said, looking at the sandy ground.

48
00:03:19.463 --> 00:03:25.133
All around them were short trees and small grassy areas too.

49
00:03:25.134 --> 00:03:28.363
It was very quiet.

50
00:03:28.364 --> 00:03:32.601
"I'm not wearing much!" Vinnie cried.

51
00:03:32.602 --> 00:03:37.282
He was only wearing short pants made out of animal skin.

52
00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:42.876
Mandy was wearing a top and a skirt made out of soft leather.

53
00:03:42.877 --> 00:03:46.769
She rubbed her hand against her skirt.

54
00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:51.153
"It feels very soft," she said.

55
00:03:51.154 --> 00:03:55.688
Vinnie walked over to a tree and leaned against it.

56
00:03:55.689 --> 00:03:58.624
"Where do you think we are?"

57
00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:02.875
"I don't—" Mandy suddenly stopped.

58
00:04:02.876 --> 00:04:05.542
She covered her mouth.

59
00:04:05.543 --> 00:04:09.148
"What is it?" Vinnie asked.

60
00:04:09.149 --> 00:04:12.218
Mandy could not speak.

61
00:04:12.219 --> 00:04:16.061
She lifted a shaking finger at Vinnie.

62
00:04:16.062 --> 00:04:20.215
He heard a low growling noise.

63
00:04:20.216 --> 00:04:24.080
Vinnie slowly turned his head.

64
00:04:24.081 --> 00:04:35.911
"Argh!" he screamed as two growling hyenas ran toward him.
